   This is a (mercifully) short posting to bid farewell to net.games.hack,
as our Pyramid machine is leaving us on May 22nd. (*sob*)  Where does this
leave PC Hack?   Since the debut of the 1.0.1 version on a PC, the ex-PDP
version will probably become a test-bed for new game and graphics ideas.
If anyone out there in netland is still interested, I would suggest getting
in touch with the folks at UCSF who posted the notice about 1.0.1 and get
a copy from them.  Our version is still somewhat buggy, and likely to remain
so - Andries Brouwer was right !

Hopefully, we will regain access to the net, but in the meantime - thanks
to one and all for corresponding, posting, flaming, etc.  It's been real.


